span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by a duergar corpse near the <a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Shadowed Battlefield</a> waypoint in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;19&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;17</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Shittin' Nere and his shittin' scouting tasks. 'You, duergar, find another way through the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Shadow Curse\">Shadow-Curse</a>', sure, right, shittin' Nere, whoever laid this curse knew their business a lot better than you do WHAT WAS THAT?\n</p><p><br>\ngnomes gnomes I killed you in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> you can't be\n</p><p><br>\nhas ha ha I found your way through the curse, shittin' Nere, the way through the Shadow-Curse is to let the curse go through YOU hahaha ha ha\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203311\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1436/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26240/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7673/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931398/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.176      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.176      1 -total\n 52.31%   24.680      6 Template:Icon_text\n 47.69%   22.497     17 Template:Trim\n 20.81%    9.819      2 Template:Uid\n 14.00%    6.606      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.57%    6.403      1 Templat